      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "超过10万观众，正发自内心地\n赞赏着小栗帽的奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dceda35f5f531367c772e50bd7c5488af96bd3495fb94797fe1494d97f0320",
