      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "也就是说，身为指引了小栗帽奔跑的老师，\n您的工作依然能完成得相当完美。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34aebca6aef249c0a403da178d6b13836cd94ef2d374deefd29980ad401a2fc8",
